.nh
.TH runc-pause "8"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
\fBrunc-pause\fP \- suspend all processes inside the container


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBrunc pause\fP \fIcontainer-id\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
The \fBpause\fP command suspends all processes in the instance of the container
identified by \fIcontainer-id\fP\&.

.PP
Use \fBrunc list\fP to identify instances of containers and their current status.


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBrunc-list\fP(8),
\fBrunc-resume\fP(8),
\fBrunc\fP(8).
